    {
      "type": "entry",
      "wm-id": 2022,
      "wm-property": "in-reply-to",
      "wm-target": "http://localhost:8080/articles/fixture-article/",
      "url": "https://aaronparecki.com/articles-fixture-article-in-reply-to-2022",
      "published": "2026-08-30T15:54:00Z",
      "author": {
        "name": "Aaron Parecki",
        "url": "https://aaronparecki.com/",
        "photo": ""
      },
      "content": {
        "text": "The permalink-first framing is the part people skip. Syndication is easy; owning the canonical URL is the work."
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "entry",
      "wm-id": 2023,
      "wm-property": "in-reply-to",
      "wm-target": "http://localhost:8080/articles/fixture-article/",
      "url": "https://jacky.wtf/articles-fixture-article-in-reply-to-2023",
      "published": "2026-08-30T16:01:00Z",
      "author": {
        "name": "Jacky Alcine",
        "url": "https://jacky.wtf/",
        "photo": ""
      },
      "content": {
        "text": "Been running this setup for three years now. The bit that finally made it click was treating webmentions as the reply channel rather than bolting comments on."
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "entry",
      "wm-id": 2024,
      "wm-property": "in-reply-to",
      "wm-target": "http://localhost:8080/articles/fixture-article/",
      "url": "https://martymcgui.re/articles-fixture-article-in-reply-to-2024",
      "published": "2026-08-30T17:08:00Z",
      "author": {
        "name": "Marty McGuire",
        "url": "https://martymcgui.re/",
        "photo": ""
      },
      "content": {
        "text": "Good writeup. One thing I'd add: microformats2 pays off the moment a second consumer shows up \u2014 a reader, a search tool, Bridgy. Before that it feels like ceremony."
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "entry",
      "wm-id": 2025,
      "wm-property": "mention-of",
      "wm-target": "http://localhost:8080/articles/fixture-article/",
      "url": "https://snarfed.org/articles-fixture-article-mention-of-2025",
      "published": "2026-08-30T18:15:00Z",
      "author": {
        "name": "Ryan Barrett",
        "url": "https://snarfed.org/",
        "photo": ""
      },
      "content": {
        "text": "Linked this in my weekly roundup \u2014 the clearest short explanation of publish-then-syndicate I've read."
      }
    },
